language and colour tables from its dist/languages.js, dist/token-types.js and its pierre-light and
pierre-dark themes. The package's LICENSE.md and NOTICE.md are in assets/vendor/highlights/, which the app
bundle carries (Contents/Resources/assets/vendor/highlights/ on macOS).

