2013-2020 Khan Academy and other contributors; the fonts ship in that package, which states no other
licence for them). tools/generate/gen-mermaid.mjs copies them from the pinned packages into each page's vendor/
folder with their licence files (LICENSE-pele, LICENSE-dompurify, LICENSE-katex); they are built, not
committed. Mermaid 11.17.2 (MIT), which the Mermaid page loaded before pele, is no longer vendored.
